--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project links against the following third-party components. Their licenses
are permissive and compatible with redistribution under Apache-2.0; each remains
under its own terms.

* opendrive (https://github.com/itdesigners/opendrive-rs)
  OpenDRIVE 1.7 data model, parser and writer. MIT License.
  Its documentation quotes the ASAM OpenDRIVE XML schema; ASAM grants everyone a
  basic, non-exclusive and unlimited license to use the ASAM OpenDRIVE standard
  (see https://www.asam.net/license).

* simple_lanelet2 (https://github.com/hakuturu583/simple_lanelet2)
  Lanelet2-compatible data model, OSM XML I/O, projections and routing.
  BSD 3-Clause License, itself derived from Lanelet2 (Fraunhofer IOSB /
  Karlsruhe Institute of Technology), BSD 3-Clause.

* symbios-shape (https://github.com/TheJanusStream/symbios-shape)
  A derivation engine for CGA shape grammars, used by `roadgen-buildings` to turn a
  lot into the buildings standing on it. MIT License.

* PyO3 (https://github.com/PyO3/pyo3)
  Rust bindings for Python. Apache-2.0.

* uom, vec1, xml-rs, chrono, url, thiserror, derive_more, paste, backtrace
  Transitive dependencies of `opendrive`, each under MIT and/or Apache-2.0.

* quick-xml, parking_lot, rstar
  Transitive dependencies of `simple_lanelet2`, each under MIT and/or Apache-2.0.

* glam, nom, rand, rand_pcg, symbios-genetics
  Transitive dependencies of `symbios-shape`, each under MIT and/or Apache-2.0.
